**Wait Best Practices:**

**✅ DO:**

**1. Use Explicit Waits (Recommended):**
```java
WebDriverWait wait = new WebDriverWait(driver, Duration.ofSeconds(10));
wait.until(ExpectedConditions.elementToBeClickable(By.id("button")));
```

**2. Wait for Specific Conditions:**
```java
// Good - Wait for clickability
wait.until(ExpectedConditions.elementToBeClickable(By.id("submit")));

// Good - Wait for invisibility
wait.until(ExpectedConditions.invisibilityOfElementLocated(By.id("loader")));
```

**3. Create Reusable Wait Objects:**
```java
public class BaseTest {
    protected WebDriverWait wait;

    @BeforeMethod
    public void setUp() {
        driver = new ChromeDriver();
        wait = new WebDriverWait(driver, Duration.ofSeconds(10));
    }
}
```

**4. Use Appropriate Timeouts:**
```java
// Short timeout for fast operations
WebDriverWait shortWait = new WebDriverWait(driver, Duration.ofSeconds(5));

// Long timeout for slow operations
WebDriverWait longWait = new WebDriverWait(driver, Duration.ofSeconds(30));
```

**❌ DON'T:**

**1. Don't Use Thread.sleep():**
```java
// Bad - Fixed wait, wastes time
Thread.sleep(5000);
driver.findElement(By.id("element")).click();

// Good - Dynamic wait
wait.until(ExpectedConditions.elementToBeClickable(By.id("element"))).click();
```

**2. Don't Mix Implicit and Explicit Waits:**
```java
// Bad - Can cause unpredictable timeouts
driver.manage().timeouts().implicitlyWait(Duration.ofSeconds(10));
WebDriverWait wait = new WebDriverWait(driver, Duration.ofSeconds(20));
// Total wait could be 10 + 20 = 30 seconds!

// Good - Use only explicit waits
WebDriverWait wait = new WebDriverWait(driver, Duration.ofSeconds(10));
```

**3. Don't Use Excessive Timeouts:**
```java
// Bad - Too long
WebDriverWait wait = new WebDriverWait(driver, Duration.ofSeconds(60));

// Good - Reasonable timeout
WebDriverWait wait = new WebDriverWait(driver, Duration.ofSeconds(10));
```

**Summary:**
✅ Use explicit waits with ExpectedConditions
✅ Wait for specific conditions (clickable, visible, invisible)
✅ Create reusable wait objects
✅ Use appropriate timeout values
❌ Avoid Thread.sleep()
❌ Don't mix implicit and explicit waits
❌ Don't use excessive timeouts

